 <body><main id="game"><canvas id="view"></canvas><div class="vignette"></div><header class="topbar"><div class="brand">LAST <span>LIGHT</span> <span style="color:#a7ab99">/ DEAD COUNTY</span></div><div class="daybox">WEDNESDAY · OCT 14<strong id="clock">DAY 01 · 07:20 AM</strong></div></header><section class="status"><div class="mini-label">Survivor condition</div><div class="statrow">HEALTH <div class="bar"><i id="healthbar"></i></div><b id="healthnum">100</b></div><div class="statrow">STAMINA <div class="bar green"><i id="stambar"></i></div><b id="stamnum">100</b></div><div class="statrow">HUNGER <div class="bar blue"><i id="foodbar"></i></div><b id="foodnum">100</b></div></section><canvas id="map"></canvas><div class="crosshair"></div><div class="prompt" id="prompt"></div><div class="toast" id="toast"></div><section class="bottom"><div class="weapon"><div class="name" id="weaponname">PIPE WRENCH <small>[1]</small></div><div class="ammo" id="weaponinfo">MELEE · STURDY</div></div><div class="hint">WASD MOVE &nbsp;·&nbsp; MOUSE LOOK<br>CLICK / SPACE ATTACK &nbsp;·&nbsp; E INTERACT</div></section><div class="right-hud">[ I ] INVENTORY &nbsp; [ C ] CRAFT<br>[ F ] QUICK PICKUP &nbsp; [ ESC ] CLOSE</div><div class="mobile-controls"><div class="touchpad"><button data-move="forward">▲</button><button data-move="left">◀</button><button data-move="back">▼</button><button data-move="right">▶</button></div><div class="touch-actions"><button class="touch-action" id="touchInteract">INTERACT</button><button class="touch-action" id="touchAttack">ATTACK</button><button class="touch-action" id="touchCraft">BAG / CRAFT</button></div></div>
 <div class="title-screen" id="title"><div class="title-content"><div class="title-kicker">A FIRST-PERSON SURVIVAL SIM</div><h1>LAST<span>LIGHT</span></h1><div class="subtitle">Dead County · Day 01 · 07:20 AM</div><p>The county is gone. The dead own the streets. Scavenge what you can, fortify a place to sleep, and keep your engine alive long enough to make it through the night.</p><button class="startbtn" id="start">ENTER THE COUNTY&nbsp; →</button><p class="controlsline">WASD MOVE &nbsp; / &nbsp; MOUSE LOOK &nbsp; / &nbsp; CLICK ATTACK &nbsp; / &nbsp; E INTERACT</p></div></div><div class="death-screen" id="death"><div><div class="title-kicker">DAY <span id="deathDay">01</span> · RUN ENDED</div><h2>YOU DIDN'T MAKE IT.</h2><p class="message" id="deathMsg">Dead County keeps its own.</p><button class="startbtn" id="restart">TRY AGAIN</button></div></div>

